
<p>John Ternus, posting on X:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>The way Steve taught us to care about every detail, every
experience, every person, still guides our work today. Forever
grateful.</p>
</blockquote>

<p><a href="https://x.com/tim_cook/status/2107093457063805380">Tim Cook</a>, also on X (with <a href="https://daringfireball.net/misc/2026/10/steve-jobs-via-tim-cook.jpeg">a photo</a> I don’t recall seeing before):</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>There are people who leave a mark on the world, and then there are
people who change it entirely. Steve changed the world and so many
lives in the process. He certainly changed my life forever. His
spirit lives on in everything he created and everyone he inspired.</p>
</blockquote>

